category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libuuid-devel
sdesc: "Lightweight cross platform C++ GUID/UUID library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "CrossGuid is a minimal, cross platform, C++ GUID library. It uses the best
native GUID/UUID generator on the given platform and has a generic class for
parsing, stringifying, and comparing IDs."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/graeme-hill/crossguid
license: MIT
